BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:donousa-stavros-dormition-panigiri-stavros-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270814
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270816
SUMMARY:Dormition panigiri\, Stavros
LOCATION:Stavros\, Donousa\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The port village of Stavros hosts Donousa's biggest feast on 14-15 August: liturgy\, then patatato (goat with potatoes) and other local dishes served to everyone\, with live traditional music and dancing on the square until late. The island has a handful of rooms and one ferry a day\; book both months ahead.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/donousa/#stavros-dormition-panigiri-stavros
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/donousa/#stavros-dormition-panigiri-stavros
END:VEVENT
