BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:donousa-mersini-panigiri-of-agia-sofia-mersini-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270916
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270918
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agia Sofia\, Mersini
LOCATION:Mersini\, Donousa\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The spring village of Mersini\, with its plane tree and view down to Livadi beach\, celebrates its church of Agia Sofia in mid-September with a liturgy and a meal and music in the courtyard. The church calendar puts Agia Sofia on 17 September\, though local listings give 19 September\, so confirm at the port when you arrive.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/donousa/#mersini-panigiri-of-agia-sofia-mersini
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/donousa/#mersini-panigiri-of-agia-sofia-mersini
END:VEVENT
